{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">EXTENT function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309442","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/EXTENT-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/EXTENT-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"EXTENT-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">EXTENT function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"EXTENT-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">This function returns the extent of an array\nfield or variable as an INTEGER value. More specifically, it returns:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">The constant or variable extent value for a field or variable defined\nas a determinate array</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>) for a field or variable defined\nas an unfixed indeterminate array</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The extent for a field or variable defined as a fixed indeterminate array</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">Zero for a field or variable that is not an array</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\" id=\"EXTENT-function__note_N1004B_N10024_N10021_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> The EXTENT function corresponds to the EXTENT\nattribute.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"EXTENT-function__syntax_GC17JY2691501\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d177723e117\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"EXTENT-function__idGDK2CS2669451\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>EXTENT ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">array</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">array</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">Any array field or variable. </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"EXTENT-function__example_GC17JZ2691507\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d177723e161\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">In\nthe following example, the EXTENT function is used to set the limit\nof a DO loop that cycles through all elements of an array:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-arrext.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"EXTENT-function__idGDK2CT2669457\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE int_value AS INTEGER NO-UNDO EXTENT 3 INITIAL [1, 2, 3].\nDEFINE VARIABLE ix        AS INTEGER NO-UNDO .\nDEFINE VARIABLE tot       AS INTEGER NO-UNDO LABEL &quot;The total is&quot;.\n\nDO ix = 1 TO <strong class=\"ph b\">EXTENT(int_value):</strong>\n  tot = tot + int_value[ix].\nEND.\n\nDISPLAY tot.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"EXTENT-function__see-also_GC17K12691513\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d177723e199\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINE-VARIABLE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINE-VARIABLE-statement.html\">DEFINE VARIABLE statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ENTRY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ENTRY-function.html\">ENTRY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"EXTENT-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/EXTENT-attribute.html\">EXTENT attribute</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"EXTENT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/EXTENT-statement.html\">EXTENT statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Expression.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Expression.html\">Expression</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"EXTENT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/EXTENT-statement.html\">EXTENT statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309442","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":809,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"EXTENT function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/EXTENT-function.html","type":"Manual"}